| norspa.sbt 1;1 - normalize spaces in DUSCI (.txx) stream
| 1;1 2017-07-07/08 J E Sullivan
| States:
|   1 BOF - just copying until space or perhaps [fts~...] followed by space
|   2 after passed-over space(s) awaiting nonspace before which to insert deferred space
|   3 after passed-over space(s) in an [fte... sequence
|   4 normal - just copying, like state 1 except for space after [fts~...]
|   5 after space foll'g [fts~.] - like state 2 but NOT inserting deferred space
|   6 within an "ExactTranslation" style or "[as-is]" segment
| Rules for state 1
 ~~1~2~ | pass over any space & go to state 2
|028fts|~b|031 ~|028fts|~b|031~1~5~ | just discard any space afr [fts~.]
|028fts|~i|031 ~|028fts|~i|031~1~5~
|028fts|~s|031 ~|028fts|~s|031~1~5~
|028fts|~u|031 ~|028fts|~u|031~1~5~
