|028fts|~5|031 ~|028fts|~5|031~1~5~
|028es|~ExactTranslation|031~|028es|~ExactTranslation|031~1~6~
|028as-is|031~|028as-is|031~1~6~
| Rules for state 2
 ~~2~ | discard excess spaces
|028fte~|028fte~2~3~ | if [fte after space(s) goto state 3
|028es|~ExactTranslation|031~ |028es|~ExactTranslation|031~2~6~
|028as-is|031~ |028as-is|031~2~6~
